DESCRIPTION:Notes:\nThis holiday is designated as "Inauguration Day" in s
 ection 6103(c) of title 5 of the United States Code\, which is the law t
 hat specifies holidays for Federal employees. Federal employees in the W
 ashington\, DC\, area are entitled to a holiday on the day a President i
 s inaugurated on January 20th for each fourth year after 1965.\n\nOPM.go
 v URL: https://www.opm.gov/policy-data-oversight/pay-leave/federal-holid
 ays/tabs/2021/
END:VEVENT
